 class="eve-app tw:@[429px]:line-clamp-2 tw:@[1100px]:truncate">Sanierung einer Wohnanlage</h2></a></div><div class="tw:grid-area-body tw:flex tw:flex-col tw:@[828px]:flex-row tw:gap-xs tw:@[828px]:gap-md tw:divide-y tw:@[828px]:divide-y-0 tw:@[828px]:divide-x tw:border-solid tw:divide-black-16 tw:py-sm tw:@[568px]:pb-0 tw:@[828px]:py-0 tw:divide-x-0 tw:border-hidden tw:@[828px]:border-hidden"><div class="tw:hidden tw:@[429px]:block tw:eve-text-sm tw:@[828px]:pr-md tw:flex-1 tw:border-b-0"><div class="tw:line-clamp-2 tw:@[828px]:line-clamp-6 tw:@[1100px]:line-clamp-4">Vonovia modernisiert gemeinsam mit der Deutschen Energie-Agentur (Dena) und der Klimaschutzagentur-Region Hannover in Hannover-Sahlkamp seriell sieben Mehrfamilienhäuser im Hagebuttenweg mit 75 Wohneinheiten und rund 6.100 m² Wohnfläche. Dafür werden im Werk vorgefertigte Fassaden-, Dach- und Energiemodule nach dem Energiesprong-Prinzip...</div></div><div class="tw:flex tw:pb-xs tw:@[828px]:pb-0 tw:@[828px]:pr-md tw:@[828px]:w-[118px] tw:@[1100px]:w-[310px]"><div class="craft-codes tw:flex tw:overflow-hidden tw:flex-wrap tw:@[828px]:flex-wrap tw:gap-2xs tw:@[828px]:gap-xs tw:h-[24px] tw:@[828px]:h-fit tw:w-full tw:z-50" data-controller="craft-codes"><a href="/auftraege/auftrag-suchen?search%5Bcraft_code_ids%5D%5B%5D=292&search%5Bfederal_states%5D%5B%5D=Niedersachsen&search%5Binclude_archived%5D=false&search%5Binclude_discarded%5D=false&search%5Binclude_remembered%5D=true&search%5Binclude_viewed%5D=true&search%5Bper_page%5D=10&search%5Bquery_operator%5D=and&search%5Bregion_type%5D=federal_states&search%5Bsort_order%5D=best&search%5Buse_additional_procedure_stadiums%5D=false" class="badge-link-container tw:cursor-pointer tw:w-fit tw:outline-0"><span class="tw:whitespace-nowrap basic-badge badges-brand-light-linked craft-code tw:truncate tw:inline-block! tw:leading-(--tw-spacing-lg)! tw:max-w-[calc(100%_-_52px)] tw:@[568px]:max-w-full" data-controller="tooltip" data-tooltip-text-value="Baumeisterarbeiten"